OL,3,AThree Saudi nationals killed in Houthi
OL,4,Aattacks on Riyadh airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Saudi nationals have been killed
OL,7,Fin two attacks on the international
OL,8,Fairport in the capital, Riyadh, the
OL,9,Fcountry's civil aviation authority has
OL,10,Fsaid after Yemen's Houthis said they
OL,11,Ftargeted the facility.
OL,13,FThe attacks also resulted in "injuries
OL,14,Fto a number of Saudi citizens and
OL,15,Fresidents of various nationalities",
OL,16,Fthe General Authority of Civil Aviation
OL,17,Fsaid in a statement on X.
OL,19,FIt said the first attack on Thursday
OL,20,Ftargeted the airport while the second
OL,21,Fone struck an aircraft belonging to
OL,22,Fstate carrier Saudia.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
